     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font:13px/normal Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Hi 世彥,</span><div style=\"font:13px/normal Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></div><div style=\"font:13px/normal Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">可以使用 ggplot2 套件中的 annotate 方法, 參考以下程式碼與輸出圖形:</div><div style=\"font:13px/normal Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></div><div style=\"font:13px/normal Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><a href=\"http://web.ydu.edu.tw/~alan9956/R/add_shaded_rectangles.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://web.ydu.edu.tw/~alan9956/R/add_shaded_rectangles.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238674019000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2huexI6c7ldxORFnWpONP8\">http://web.ydu.edu.tw/~alan9956/R/add_shaded_rectangles.png</a></div><div style=\"font:13px/normal Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></div><div style=\"font:13px/normal Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\"># title: add the shaded rectangles in multiple lines</font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\"># date: 2014.3.21</font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">library(ggplot2)</font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">set.seed(123456)</font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">start &lt;- as.POSIXct(&quot;2014-03-01 00:00:00&quot;)</font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">end &lt;- as.POSIXct(&quot;2014-03-10 23:00:00&quot;)</font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">datetime &lt;- seq.POSIXt(from=start, by=60*60, to=end)</font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">value &lt;- cumsum(runif(240, -5, 5))</font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">machine &lt;- data.frame(datetime, logdate=format(datetime,&quot;%Y-%m-%d&quot;), value)</font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">timespan &lt;- format(machine$datetime, &quot;%H:%M&quot;)</font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">p &lt;- ggplot(machine, aes(x=timespan, y=value, group=logdate, colour=logdate)) + geom_point() + geom_line() + xlab(&quot;時間&quot;) + ylab(&quot;測量值&quot;) + ggtitle(&quot;2014年3月-感知監測圖&quot;)</font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">p + annotate(&quot;rect&quot;, xmin=c(1,6,11,13,17,21,23), xmax=c(6,11,13,17,21,23,24), ymin=min(machine$value), ymax=max(machine$value), alpha=.5, fill=c(1:7))</font></div></div><br><br>陳世彥於 2014年3月10日星期一UTC+8下午5時47分37秒寫道：</div>"
